          "eyebrow": "Overview",
          "heading": "A dispatch tool that grew faster than its users",
          "summary": "Northwind's console started as a spreadsheet replacement and quietly became mission-critical. Over six years, 140 features were bolted on without a shared pattern library. I led the end-to-end redesign — from field research to a shipped design system — with a PM and four engineers.",
